 },
 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "Base change for the lower shriek on $D_{\\mathrm{cons}}$",
 "statement": "Let $\\Lambda$ be $\\underline E$ for a finite extension $E$ of $\\mathbf Q_\\ell$\n([sk-def-sfb-condensed-ring]) or $\\Lambda=\\underline{\\Qlb}$ ([sk-def-sfb-qlbar-condensed]). For\nevery cartesian square\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{ccc}\nX' & \\xrightarrow{\\;g'\\;} & X\\\\\n{\\scriptstyle f'}\\downarrow & & \\downarrow{\\scriptstyle f}\\\\\nY' & \\xrightarrow{\\;g\\;} & Y\n\\end{array}\n$$\n\nof the setting and every compactification $c$ of $f$, the compact-support base change morphism\nof [sk-def-sfb-shriek-base-change-morphism],\n\n$$\n\\mathrm{Ex}_!^c\\colon Lg^*\\circ Rf_!^c\\xrightarrow{\\ \\sim\\ }Rf'^{\\,c'}_!\\circ Lg'^*,\n$$\n\nis an isomorphism of functors $D_{\\mathrm{cons}}(X,\\Lambda)\\to D_{\\mathrm{cons}}(Y',\\Lambda)$, with\n$c'$ the base-changed compactification. No properness of $f$ is assumed.",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/main-20261015/blueprint/sec-six-functors-basics/sk-thm-sfb-shriek-base-change/_section.md",
  "place": "node sk-thm-sfb-shriek-base-change, order 1697"
 },
 "stmt_deps": [
  "sk-def-sfb-condensed-ring",
  "sk-def-sfb-qlbar-condensed",
  "sk-def-sfb-shriek-base-change-morphism"
 ],
 "proof": [
  {
   "text": "By definition ([sk-def-sfb-shriek-base-change-morphism]), $\\mathrm{Ex}_!^c$ is the composite of\ntwo morphisms. The first is the base change morphism of the cartesian square formed by\n$p\\colon Z\\to Y$, $p'\\colon Z\\times_YY'\\to Y'$ and the projections, whiskered by $i_!$. Since $p$\nis proper, this is an isomorphism by proper base change [sk-thm-sfb-proper-base-change] for\n$\\Lambda=\\underline E$ resp. $\\underline{\\Qlb}$. The second is $Rp'_*$ applied to the inverse of\nthe extension-by-zero exchange isomorphism ([sk-def-sfb-open-base-change]), which is an\nisomorphism. A composite of isomorphisms is an isomorphism. Properness enters only through the\nstructure morphism $p$ of the compactification, not through $f$.",
   "uses": [
    "sk-def-sfb-shriek-base-change-morphism",
    "sk-def-sfb-open-base-change"
   ],
   "elementary": false
  }
 ],
 "proof_deps": [
  "sk-def-sfb-shriek-base-change-morphism",
  "sk-def-sfb-open-base-change"
 ],
